            "lens": "review-reliability",
            "findings": [],
            "evidence": [
              "Clearance in engine/review/check.go returns ErrNoResult for an empty list, returns ErrBlocked on any blocking result regardless of order, and treats Unverified or an undecided outcome as ErrNotClear. A check that did not run therefore never passes. check_test.go covers each of these orderings.",
              "CheckBinding in engine/review/check.go compares base, head, diff digest and ordered paths. check_test.go asserts the wrapped error and the differing member and values for each case, including reordered and truncated paths.",
              "ResultsOfHead in engine/review/check.go filters by head prefix and CheckResultName, then sorts by numeric launch number so 10 follows 2. It does not mutate its input. The tests assert the ordering, the exclusion of verdict, tmp, hidden, zero-padded and other-head names, the empty and too-short head cases, and that the input slice is unchanged.",
              "The review.go change is documentation only. The test helpers candidate, headSHA, baseSHA and diffSHA are not visible in this candidate and are assumed to exist elsewhere in the package's test files."
            ]
          }
        }
